<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλογ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>balancing of accounts,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				36.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				17.17
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1432.6
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Messene</span>), etc.: hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>calculation, consideration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				367a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. λαβεῖν περὶ σφῶν αὐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					5.3.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δ. οὗτος</span> this
				<i>consideration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>debate, argument, discussion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				138
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.180c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>circuit court,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ νομοῦ δ. ποιῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.358.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				19i13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>judicial inquiry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				27.35
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				66.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
